<div class="question">
<h2 class="question-title">瞎扯 · 如何评价《爱的教育》这本书？</h2>

<div class="answer">

<div class="meta">
<img class="avatar" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-fc734cfcc0b308e24640f9b5a2d2316d_l.jpg?source=8673f162">
<span class="author">知乎日报</span>
<a href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/None/answer/None" class="originUrl" hidden>查看知乎原文</a>
</div>

<div class="content">
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/33655188/answer/2032962309061091757"> 如何评价《爱的教育》这本书？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/3e7c9ba288f4652f22c13d832d686daf" target="_blank">@姜姬与猹</a></div>
：「老师，我们家子涵……」意大利 19 世纪版</blockquote>
<figure>
<div class="RichText-ConditionalImagePortal"><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0cc66dc534de3fb4c0afbf728593cd9e_1440w.jpg" alt=""></div>
<figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/305724599/answer/1991470056530547225"> 如何评价大熊猫的颜值？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/984c976cfdf8426f443cf0799f486b44" target="_blank">@大山背面是海</a></div>
：成年熊猫甚至能和满两月的土狗比一比</blockquote>
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/36412943/answer/2091598267897464628">为什么现在小孩的名字都这么俗？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/cec7674f755137a3281e790de7ccc1fb" target="_blank">@大海</a></div>
:夫妻都姓贺，三个儿子：贺力员、贺加贝、<a class="RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1" href="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=287712136&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E8%B4%BA%E5%8B%8B&amp;zhida_source=entity" target="_blank">贺勋</a>。我是认识其中一个，才知道的这个事。</blockquote>
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/1941094662753476659/answer/2024470906085414864">体育比赛中出现过哪些</a>「<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/1941094662753476659/answer/2024470906085414864">世界名画</a>」<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/1941094662753476659/answer/2024470906085414864">？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/d3b351d9473dfebcf5d540d80aefb106" target="_blank">@若钢</a></div>
：那一天，常州的雨很大。</blockquote>
<figure>
<div class="RichText-ConditionalImagePortal"><img class="content-image" src="https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-205b3cd9fcfd1813e8cb108613efe222_1440w.jpg" alt=""></div>
<figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/641372499/answer/97585828918">在国外旅行时，你发现过哪些中国符号？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/0a6fb30f4c52061182af137fd89f0fef" target="_blank">@莫哲</a></div>
： 2018 年，在俄罗斯的某家商店里发现的……</blockquote>
<figure>
<div class="RichText-ConditionalImagePortal"><img class="content-image" src="https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-8a51545654b9a6f591841fc3a8e171f2_1440w.jpg" alt=""></div>
<figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<hr>
